{
  "file_id": "ID03587",
  "text_count": 113,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������Hey! Taichi's writing an email!\nWhat's it say?",
      "_offset": 5377,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "\"Dear Sora, it was my fault, so\ndon't be angry anymore...\"",
      "_offset": 5432,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Don't read my emails! Hey, are you\ngoing somewhere?",
      "_offset": 5491,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "I'm going to a friend's birthday\nparty! I'm getting her this\npresent!",
      "_offset": 5543,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Hmmmm? Gimme!",
      "_offset": 5613,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "No!",
      "_offset": 5627,
      "_length": 3,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "You can't just keep it to\nyourself!",
      "_offset": 5631,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "If you wanna send an email, all\nyou gotta do is click here!",
      "_offset": 5667,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Don't just *send* it!",
      "_offset": 5727,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 28,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Why not?",
      "_offset": 5749,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Huh? Mail rejected? Come *on*,\nSora...",
      "_offset": 5758,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hey, Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 5797,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "*pant* *pant* The egg...",
      "_offset": 5813,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Huh?",
      "_offset": 5838,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "The egg... hatched!",
      "_offset": 5843,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "The heck is this? It's like a\nsquishy little jellyfish.",
      "_offset": 5863,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 5,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "It's a species of Digimon that\nI've never seen before.",
      "_offset": 5919,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Huh, it's pretty cute! So what\nabout it?",
      "_offset": 5974,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "It seems that the egg was formed\nfrom the combination of many\ncomputer bugs.",
      "_offset": 6015,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "The jellyfish evolved!",
      "_offset": 6092,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "It grows by eating data...",
      "_offset": 6115,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "It's only a Baby, but at this rate\nit'll eat up all the data on the\nInternet!",
      "_offset": 6142,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "What'll happen if it eats data?",
      "_offset": 6220,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Everything will go haywire!",
      "_offset": 6252,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 6280,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Hey, can't we find a way to get\nrid of the jellyfish from inside\nthe Internet?",
      "_offset": 6287,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "We can't...",
      "_offset": 6366,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "I was emailing a friend in LA who \nsaid they were in contact with \nvarious organizations, but...",
      "_offset": 6378,
      "_length": 96,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "They couldn't get anyone to\nlisten...",
      "_offset": 6475,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Ack! It evolved again!",
      "_offset": 6513,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Now it's in its Child form.",
      "_offset": 6536,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Uh-oh! Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 6564,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "We have to get rid of him somehow!",
      "_offset": 6582,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "But how?",
      "_offset": 6617,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Well...",
      "_offset": 6626,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Ugh... Times like this, I wish\nAgumon were here...",
      "_offset": 6634,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 6685,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Huh? Agumon?",
      "_offset": 6693,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 6706,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Agumon! Agumon, it's you!",
      "_offset": 6714,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Taichi! We're receiving a\ntransmission from the Digital\nWorld!",
      "_offset": 6740,
      "_length": 62,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Taichi!",
      "_offset": 6803,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "It's been a while.",
      "_offset": 6811,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Gennai!",
      "_offset": 6830,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "How're you doin', Koushirou?",
      "_offset": 6838,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Tentomon!",
      "_offset": 6867,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Hey!",
      "_offset": 6877,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Piyomon! Gabumon! Palmon! Hey,\neveryone's here!",
      "_offset": 6882,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "So, I assume you already know\nabout it, right?",
      "_offset": 6930,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "There's a new Digimon on the\nInternet.",
      "_offset": 6977,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "See, I thought you would.",
      "_offset": 7016,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "This isn't looking good, Taichi!\nIt's a really dangerous Digimon!",
      "_offset": 7042,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Yeah! But how are we supposed to\ntake care of it?",
      "_offset": 7108,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 5,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We'll fight, Taichi!",
      "_offset": 7158,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "But...",
      "_offset": 7179,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "We'll go into the Internet.",
      "_offset": 7186,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "You're the ones who saved our\nworld...",
      "_offset": 7214,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "so this time 'round, we'll be the\nones to save yours!",
      "_offset": 7253,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Tentomon!",
      "_offset": 7307,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Okay, guys!",
      "_offset": 7317,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "We're counting on you. Got your\nDigivice, Koushirou?",
      "_offset": 7329,
      "_length": 52,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "Got your Digivice, Koushirou?",
      "_offset": 7382,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "Of course!",
      "_offset": 7412,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Of course!",
      "_offset": 7423,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Okay! We've got our Digivices, so\nyou'll be able to evolve!",
      "_offset": 7434,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 7494,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "I'll be sending the Digimon in, so\nhang tight.",
      "_offset": 7500,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "I'll get in touch with the others!",
      "_offset": 7547,
      "_length": 34,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "None of them are home... Hey,\nKoushirou, can you call Sora for\nme?",
      "_offset": 7582,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "Did something happen?",
      "_offset": 7649,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Nothing in particular, just...",
      "_offset": 7671,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "Did you two just happen to get in\na fight?",
      "_offset": 7702,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "It wasn't a fight! Anyway, isn't\nit time?",
      "_offset": 7745,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Transmission complete!",
      "_offset": 7787,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Taichi! Koushirou! We'll be there\nsoon!",
      "_offset": 7810,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Taichi! Koushirou! We'll be there\nsoon!",
      "_offset": 7850,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "We're counting on you, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 7890,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "It hasn't noticed us yet! Let's\nlaunch a surprise attack!",
      "_offset": 7921,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Right-o! I'm goin' in!",
      "_offset": 7979,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Why's there Digimon all over?",
      "_offset": 8002,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "The mysterious Digimon may have\ncaused them to appear...",
      "_offset": 8032,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "It must have copied data from the\nDigital World.",
      "_offset": 8089,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Well, we'll just have to clear\nthem out!",
      "_offset": 8138,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "Okay, do it!",
      "_offset": 8179,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Now's the time!",
      "_offset": 8192,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "It's a Child, so you guys should\nevolve to Adult!",
      "_offset": 8208,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 5,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "_offset": 8258,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Roger!",
      "_offset": 8264,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Get him!",
      "_offset": 8271,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Ha! Piece of cake!",
      "_offset": 8280,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Wait a minute!",
      "_offset": 8299,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Did he just evolve again?!",
      "_offset": 8314,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "english": "We'll still be okay... it's an\nAdult, just like them.",
      "_offset": 8341,
      "_length": 53,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "english": "Somethin's up! What are we gonna\ndo?",
      "_offset": 8395,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "english": "Kabuterimon! Aaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 8432,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "english": "Greymon!",
      "_offset": 8454,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "english": "Taichi! I just realized! It's\nactually a Perfect-level Digimon!",
      "_offset": 8463,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "english": "So that means...",
      "_offset": 8527,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "english": "It evolved twice back then!",
      "_offset": 8544,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "english": "That's not good... okay, we'll\nhave to evolve them to Perfect\ntoo!",
      "_offset": 8572,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 4,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "english": "Aaaaaagh!",
      "_offset": 8639,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "english": "Ack!",
      "_offset": 8649,
      "_length": 4,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "english": "Did it just attack them while they\nwere evolving?",
      "_offset": 8654,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "english": "Are you okay, Agumon?",
      "_offset": 8704,
      "_length": 21,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "english": "Sorry... Taichi...",
      "_offset": 8726,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "english": "Tentomon...",
      "_offset": 8745,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "english": "That guy's out of our league...",
      "_offset": 8757,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "english": "You two need to rest for a bit.",
      "_offset": 8789,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "english": "But then... where are they gonna\nhide...",
      "_offset": 8821,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "english": "It's been a while since we've\nfought beside them.",
      "_offset": 8862,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 9,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "english": "And what about that?",
      "_offset": 8912,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "english": "It might take a while for them to\nevolve to Perfect again.",
      "_offset": 8933,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 1,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "english": "We'll just have to stick to Adult\nfor now. Let's do it!",
      "_offset": 8992,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}